{"root":{"data":{"id":"dj4q8epnam80","created":1781029407933,"text":"珠你好运"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4q8u1uo6o0","created":1781029441323,"text":"产品定位"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4q9i4hdrs0","created":1781029493725,"text":"珠你好运 是一款融合 AI、传统文化、个性化设计与珠宝电商的新一代智能手串定制平台。\n用户可以通过 AI 一键生成专属手串，也可以像搭积木一样自由DIY设计，将水晶、玉石、木质珠、配件等。\n平台通过 AI 推荐系统、能量标签系统、文化寓意系统和智能设计引擎，让每个人都能拥有属于自己的「好运手串」。","layout_right_offset":{"x":152,"y":0}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qbm9m5iw0","created":1781029659471,"text":"核心产品功能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qbpvyflc0","created":1781029667352,"text":"AI一键成串","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qbzikapc0","created":1781029688310,"text":"用户输入：想要招财、事业运提升、暖色系、适合女生日常佩戴"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qc7mspyo0","created":1781029705980,"text":"AI自动完成","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qcdtnn600","created":1781029719456,"text":"用户意图理解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcgk2mow0","created":1781029725407,"text":"风格分析"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcjbfbao0","created":1781029731414,"text":"五行分析"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcm28b7c0","created":1781029737389,"text":"水晶功效匹配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcs95npk0","created":1781029750868,"text":"SKU筛选"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcv9sfds0","created":1781029757437,"text":"模板匹配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qcxx25rc0","created":1781029763197,"text":"手围适配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qd0ko6600","created":1781029768978,"text":"自动排版"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qda288u00","created":1781029789631,"text":"输出","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qdd6ne3k0","created":1781029796429,"text":"设计图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qddzelcg0","created":1781029798168,"text":"材料清单及价格"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qdlar3p40","created":1781029814091,"text":"寓意说明"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qdv1v7mg0","created":1781029835322,"text":"AI智能推荐系统（区别于传统商品推荐）","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qe7fsg480","created":1781029862285,"text":"用户维度：年龄、性别、星座、生肖、职业、兴趣偏好"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qeqoahtc0","created":1781029904158,"text":"行为维度：浏览记录、收藏记录、DIY行为、下单记录"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qf278v0o0","created":1781029929249,"text":"场景维度：招财、事业、桃花、学业、考试、健康、平安……"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qflkajcw0","created":1781029971396,"text":"风格维度：简约、国风、轻奢、禅意……"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qg7lhmso0","created":1781030019358,"text":"智能DIY设计器","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qgsjy8hk0","created":1781030064977,"text":"类似Canva、美图秀秀、乐高搭建等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qh49pijk0","created":1781030090479,"text":"用户可以自由组合珠子、配件、绳子，组成独一无二的设计作品"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qhg7ht2o0","created":1781030116467,"text":"支持拖拽编辑、实时预览、自动对称、自动补珠，自动手围适配等"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qhyn68pk0","created":1781030156597,"text":"AI手串定制师-实现类似真人珠宝顾问体验","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qi9yb7ps0","created":1781030181215,"text":"风格设计师：色彩搭配、材质搭配、视觉平衡"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qill885k0","created":1781030206545,"text":"能量设计师：功效组合、五行平衡、场景匹配"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qivpew3s0","created":1781030228566,"text":"销售顾问：选购建议、材料解释、寓意说明"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qjmwe7i80","created":1781030287762,"text":"好运DNA系统","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qk7u3y6o0","created":1781030333336,"text":"根据用户：出生日期、星座、生肖、五行属性、行为偏好、目标、场景、风格等生成好运DNA画像"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4ql6r04a00","created":1781030409335,"text":"举例"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qldged200","created":1781030423932,"text":"财富型：适合黄水晶、金发晶、绿幽灵"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qlt05sew0","created":1781030457778,"text":"事业型：适合黑曜石、虎眼石、金耀石"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qm5oquw00","created":1781030485386,"text":"情感型：适合粉水晶、月光石、紫水晶"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qmhl66io0","created":1781030511292,"text":"形成长期个性化推荐基础"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qmnef4bc0","created":1781030523945,"text":"手串模版市场","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qmsffo0o0","created":1781030534889,"text":"设计师可以发布：原创手串、节日限定款、联名款"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qn51x1dk0","created":1781030562370,"text":"用户可以直接购买、二次编辑、AI优化"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qncn8jlc0","created":1781030578897,"text":"形成UGC生态"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qnjep7rk0","created":1781030593618,"text":"好运卡系统"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dj4qnputb7s0","created":1781030607653,"text":"每条手串附带好运档案"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dj4qo04kcjs0","created":1781030630010,"text":"包含：名称、核心寓意"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-green","version":"1.4.43"}